                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2874451,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Good evening, everyone. My name's Phil Sutton, and I'm chairman of the Highways Committee. We've called this meeting to inform members of the public about the new regulations for traffic and parking we're proposing for Granford. I'll start by summarizing these changes before we open the meeting to questions. So why do we need to make these changes to traffic systems in Granford?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2874452,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Good evening, everyone.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 60.57,
                  "from": 59.13,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874456,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My name's Phil Sutton, and I'm chairman of the Highways Committee.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 64.97,
                  "from": 60.809998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874468,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We've called this meeting to inform members of the public about the new regulations for traffic and parking we're proposing for Granford.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 74.565,
                  "from": 65.765,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874490,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'll start by summarizing these changes before we open the meeting to questions.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 80.645004,
                  "from": 75.285,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874504,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So why do we need to make these changes to traffic systems in Granford?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 87.02,
                  "from": 81.98,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2874519,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Well, we're very aware that traffic is becoming an increasing problem. It's been especially noticeable with the increase in heavy traffic while they've been building the new hospital. But it's the overall rise in the volume of traffic of all kinds that's concerning us. To date, there's not been any increase in traffic accidents, but that's not something we want to see happen, obviously. We recently carried out a survey of local residents, and their responses were interesting.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2874520,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, we're very aware that traffic is becoming an increasing problem.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 92.7,
                  "from": 87.34,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874532,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's been especially noticeable with the increase in heavy traffic while they've been building the new hospital.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 99.455,
                  "from": 93.18,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874550,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But it's the overall rise in the volume of traffic of all kinds that's concerning us.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 105.615,
                  "from": 99.935,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874567,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "To date, there's not been any increase in traffic accidents, but that's not something we want to see happen, obviously.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 113.47,
                  "from": 106.255,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874588,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We recently carried out a survey of local residents, and their responses were interesting.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 120.75,
                  "from": 114.43,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2874604,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "People were very concerned about the lack of visibility on some roads due to cars parked along the sides of the roads. We'd expected complaints about the congestion near the school when parents are dropping off their children or picking them up. But this was on top of the list, and nor were noise and fumes from trucks and lorries, though they were mentioned by some people. We think these new traffic regulations would make a lot of difference, but we still have a long way to go. We've managed to keep our proposals within budget, just so they can be covered by the council.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2874605,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "People were very concerned about the lack of visibility on some roads due to cars parked along the sides of the roads.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 128.93501,
                  "from": 120.990005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874628,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We'd expected complaints about the congestion near the school when parents are dropping off their children or picking them up.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 136.93501,
                  "from": 129.495,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874649,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But this was on top of the list, and nor were noise and fumes from trucks and lorries, though they were mentioned by some people.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 145.53001,
                  "from": 137.255,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874675,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We think these new traffic regulations would make a lot of difference, but we still have a long way to go.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 153.69,
                  "from": 146.57,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874697,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We've managed to keep our proposals within budget, just so they can be covered by the council.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.91501,
                  "from": 154.595,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2874715,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "But, of course, it's no good introducing new regulations if we don't have a way of making sure that everyone obeys them, and that's an area we're still working on with the help of representatives from the police force.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2874716,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But, of course, it's no good introducing new regulations if we don't have a way of making sure that everyone obeys them, and that's an area we're still working on with the help of representatives from the police force.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 174.07,
                  "from": 161.475,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2874756,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 14 to 20. Now listen and answer questions 14 to 20.",
