          {
            "id": 2874783,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Okay. So this slide shows a map of the central area of Granford with the High Street in the middle and School Road on the right. Now we already have a set of traffic lights in the High Street at the junction with Station Road, but we're planning to have another set at the other end at the School Road junction to regulate the flow of traffic along the High Street. We've decided we definitely need a pedestrian crossing. We considered putting this on School Road just outside the school, but in the end, we decided that could lead to a lot of traffic congestion.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2874784,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Okay.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 226.72,
                  "from": 225.36,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874786,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So this slide shows a map of the central area of Granford with the High Street in the middle and School Road on the right.",
                "meta": {
