              },
              {
                "id": 2874812,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now we already have a set of traffic lights in the High Street at the junction with Station Road, but we're planning to have another set at the other end at the School Road junction to regulate the flow of traffic along the High Street.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 251.31,
                  "from": 236.295,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874858,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We've decided we definitely need a pedestrian crossing.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 256.35,
