                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874934,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "At present, parking isn't allowed on the High Street outside the library, but we are going to change that and allow parking there, but not at the other end of the High Street near School Road.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 292.635,
                  "from": 280.09,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2874971,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There'll be a new no parking sign on School Road just by the entrance to the school, forbidding parking for 25 meters.",
